== Synergies ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: Doubles the damage of Wisps.
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Lets Lemegeton's wisps shoot homing tears once per second that deal 3 damage.}}
** Also applies to {{c|Tainted Bethany}}'s Lemegeton, despite not being visually shown.
* {{i|Rock Bottom}}: Stat increases remain even after its wisp has been destroyed.
* {{i|Satanic Bible}}: Using Lemegeton in a {{r|Boss Room}} after activating the Satanic Bible on that floor will pull from the [[Devil Room (Item Pool)|Devil Room item pool]], even if the boss wouldn't normally drop an item after defeat.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Box of Friends}}: Does not double the wisps spawned by {{I|Lemegeton}}.
* {{i|Car Battery}}: Two wisps are created on use, only the name of the second item is displayed. If a Car Battery wisp is created, another wisp is summoned immediately.
* {{I|Chaos}}: Item wisps will be selected from random pools, regardless of the room Isaac is in.
* {{I|Magic Skin}}: Can be spawned by Lemegeton if it has been used in the current run.
* {{I|Sacred Orb}}: Generated wisps are affected by Sacred Orb.
* {{i|Sacrificial Altar}}: Every wisp will be converted to a {{E|Half Soul Heart}}. [[Familiar]]s created by Lemegeton are sacrificed normally.

