== Trivia ==
* The Lemegeton is another name for the [[wikipedia:Lesser Key of Solomon|Lesser Key of Solomon]], an anonymous grimoire focused on demonology that was compiled in the 17th century.
* The symbol on the cover of Lemegeton may be the [[wikipedia:Seal of Solomon|Seal of Solomon]].

